@germany_menu
new-page: true

= Germany

- #germany_menu
- @diplomacy: Cancel action. 

@germany_improve
title: Conduct a diplomatic visit to improve relations. 
tags: germany_menu
view-if: brest_signed = 1
on-arrival: {!
  Q.germany_relation += 10;
!}

We send a diplomatic mission to Germany. 

@open_negotiations
title: Send word to the Germans that we wish to negotiate an end to the war. 
view-if: german_negotiations = 0
tags: germany_menu
on-arrival: german_negotiations = 1; is_armistice = 1; german_waiting_timer = 3; 

The Germans have accepted our emissaries and have agreed to hold talks at the headquarters of the Central Powers Armies at Brest-Litovsk. In the meantime, a local ceasefire agreement has been reached, temporarily suspending hostilities along the frontlines for the next two weeks. 

It is now up to us to prepare our contingent of negotiators and travel to Brest-Litovsk. 

@brest_litovsk
title: Dispatch a delegation to Brest-Litovsk to negotiate with the Central Powers. 
view-if: german_negotiations = 1
tags: germany_menu, foreign_special
go-to: peace_strategy
on-arrival: german_negotiations = 2;

